[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":12,"col":11},"end":{"line":12,"col":12}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"`browser-direct` does not compile markup as a value yet — markup that is not the\n`view` a program constructor is called with (held, passed or returned by another\nfunction, or a `view` that is `pub` or used elsewhere), `Html.text` and\n`Html.map` — it arrives with slice S4 (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §5.2,\n§14). Build this program with `--platform=browser-tea` until then."},{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":20,"col":59},"end":{"line":20,"col":63}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"This program's `view` is a value computed when the page runs, not a function\nwhose body the compiler can reach as markup, so `browser-direct` cannot compile\nit: the platform has no renderer to hand a `view` it did not compile\n(`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §11.1). Name a function, or write a lambda,\nwhose body is the markup; or build for `--platform=browser-tea`, which renders\nany `view`."}]
